msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:48
msgid ""
"This effect/filter crops the image to a rounded rectangle or circle by "
"padding the edges with a specified color. It can be :ref:`controlled "
"directly on the monitor <ui-monitors_effect_direct_control>`."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter orezáva obraz na zaoblený obdĺžnik alebo kruh doplnením "
"okrajov zadanou farbou. Možno ho :ref:`ovládať priamo na monitore <ui-"
"monitors_effect_direct_control>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:50
msgid ""
"This effect can be used for picture-in-picture effects. Very effective when "
"used in combination with the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"generate/drop_shadow` effect. See the tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt možno použiť pre efekty obraz v obraze. Veľmi účinný v "
"kombinácii s efektom :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/"
"drop_shadow`. Pozrite tutoriál."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:54
