#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:66
msgid ""
"If switched on, the :guilabel:`Radius` parameter creates a circular crop. "
"Otherwise a rectangle is used. Default is **off**."
msgstr ""
"Ak je zapnuté, parameter :guilabel:`Polomer` vytvorí kruhový orez. V opačnom "
"prípade sa použije obdĺžnik. Predvolene je **vypnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:67
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Polomer"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:68
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:69
msgid "Amount of circular or rectangle rounding"
msgstr "Množstvo zaoblenia kruhu alebo obdĺžnika"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:70
msgid "Padding Color"
msgstr "Výplň"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:71
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:72
msgid "The color to be used for padding. Can be alpha."
msgstr "Farba, ktorá sa má použiť na doplnenie. Môže byť priehľadná (alfa)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:76
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/crop_padding.rst:77
msgid ""
"The parameters :guilabel:`Position X`, :guilabel:`Y`, :guilabel:`Size W`, :"
"guilabel:`H`, :guilabel:`Scale` can be used to move and/or scale the "
"rectangle or circle within the frame in order to crop a specific portion of "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"Parametre :guilabel:`Pozícia X`, :guilabel:`Y`, :guilabel:`Veľkosť Š`, :"
"guilabel:`V`, :guilabel:`Mierka` možno použiť na pohyb a/alebo zmenu mierky "
"obdĺžnika alebo kruhu v rámci snímky, aby sa orezala konkrétna časť obrazu."

